  "description": "Based on a design from the collection Stray Aliens: #3 - Floraleen Elemeind\nhttps://opensea.io/assets/ethereum/0x495f947276749ce646f68ac8c248420045cb7b5e/57124830429581407560204282384407541915263222877884187177766534211619566649345\n\n\"We didn't find Floraleen, she found us. We were looking for Stray Aliens on a recently demolished planet, & this beautiful life form appeared out of nowhere. She heard that we were Alien Adoption Advocates, and insisted that we get her off this scorched rock to somewhere more green. She was reluctant to give Earth a chance after hearing some horror stories, but we insisted that life among humans will be good for her personal growth.\n\nFloraleen was very mysterious during the screening process. She did disclose that she became a Stray Alien along with her sisters. To her disbelief, Floraleen's sisters abandoned her while their planet was destroyed. Floraleen clung to life and grew herself from the dirt. Turns out she can do that! We have never seen such a thing. Floraleen will feed herself, which is an ultra-rare trait among Aliens!\n\nWhile we are eager to locate & assist the Elemeind Sisters, Floraleen warns that she is vengeful towards them.\"",
